{{!
    @template enrol_apply/queue_capacity

    The decision context above the applications queue: how many are waiting, how many are
    deferred, how full the method is and whether it is still accepting applications.

    Rendered OUTSIDE the section that depends on the queue having rows, deliberately. A method
    whose applicant limit is reached has an EMPTY queue, and that is exactly the moment its
    numbers explain something - inside that section they would vanish when they are most needed.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * tiles array - the plain counts, each an object with a value and a label
    * meters array - the counts that have a limit to sit against, each with a value, a label, a
      percentage for the bar's width and a boolean saying whether the bar is at the warning level
    * hasstatus boolean - whether an open/closed state can be reported at all, which needs an
      enrolment method in scope
    * statuslabel string - the heading of the status tile
    * isopen boolean - whether the method is accepting applications
    * statustext string - the word for that state
    * hasclosing boolean - whether a closing date is set
    * closingtext string - the sentence naming it
    * hasremaining boolean - whether the applicant limit is close enough to be worth naming
    * remainingtext string - the sentence saying how many more will be accepted

    Example context (json):
    {
        "tiles": [
            {"value": "12", "label": "Awaiting decision"},
            {"value": "3", "label": "Deferred to the waiting list"}
        ],
        "meters": [
            {"value": "8 of 20", "label": "Places taken (approved)", "percent": 40, "warn": false},
            {"value": "35 of 40", "label": "Applications held", "percent": 88, "warn": true}
        ],
        "hasstatus": true,
        "statuslabel": "Status",
        "isopen": true,
        "statustext": "Open",
        "hasclosing": true,
        "closingtext": "closes 30 September 2026",
        "hasremaining": true,
        "remainingtext": "5 more applications will be accepted before the method closes itself."
    }
}}
<div class="enrol_apply-capacity card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body d-flex flex-wrap">
        {{#tiles}}
            <div class="enrol_apply-tile">
                <span class="enrol_apply-tilevalue">{{value}}</span>
                <span class="enrol_apply-tilelabel">{{label}}</span>
            </div>
        {{/tiles}}
        {{#meters}}
            <div class="enrol_apply-tile enrol_apply-tile-meter">
                <span class="enrol_apply-tilevalue">{{value}}</span>
                <span class="enrol_apply-tilelabel">{{label}}</span>
                <span class="enrol_apply-meter" role="presentation">
                    <span class="enrol_apply-meterfill {{#warn}}enrol_apply-meterfill-warn{{/warn}}"
                          style="width: {{percent}}%"></span>
                </span>
            </div>
        {{/meters}}
        {{#hasstatus}}
            <div class="enrol_apply-tile enrol_apply-tile-status">
                <span class="enrol_apply-tilelabel">{{statuslabel}}</span>
                <span>
                    {{#isopen}}<span class="badge bg-success text-white">{{statustext}}</span>{{/isopen}}
                    {{^isopen}}<span class="badge bg-secondary text-dark">{{statustext}}</span>{{/isopen}}
                    {{#hasclosing}}<span class="small text-muted">{{closingtext}}</span>{{/hasclosing}}
                </span>
                {{#hasremaining}}
                    <span class="small text-muted">{{remainingtext}}</span>
                {{/hasremaining}}
            </div>
        {{/hasstatus}}
    </div>
</div>
